BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  In the dawn of the First Era, the Valley of Aethel was barren, save for the single Golden Kern) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    el held by the Weaver. The Weaver could hoard the Kernel, clutching it tight in a fist of bo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    ne, but it would remain a single grain, offering no sustenance. Instead, the Weaver crossed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    the threshold to the Tiller's garden, offering the Kernel to the earth. Through the Tiller's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (     grace, the soil amplified the grain, multiplying the Weaver's trust into three stalks of bo) Tj ET
