BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      In the primordial era, the Great Sun and the Silent Earth existed in a cycle of eternal ex) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (        change. The Sun, possessing the radiant fire of creation, would cast its golden rays tow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        ard the earth. This was the offering. If the Earth kept the warmth locked within its cru) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        st, the world stagnated, turning brittle and barren. But when the Earth opened its valle) Tj ET
