BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        ack the vitality of life-the fragrant blossoms and the cool, damp mist.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      This was the Law of the Radiant Cycle: the Sun sent the fire, and the Earth returned the f) Tj ET
