BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        lden loom, which possessed the power to multiply whatever was placed upon it. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      If the Weaver kept the thread, the canyon remained silent and barren. If the Weaver cast t) Tj ET
