BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        ing its worth. The Weaver often feared the Merchant might shroud the tapestry in secrecy) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        , keeping the entire bounty. Yet, the Merchant understood that if the thread never arriv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        ed, the loom would remain cold and empty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      One day, the Weaver took a leap of faith and tossed the silver thread. The Merchant, recog) Tj ET
