BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        ity. She returned a bountiful harvest to Sol, ensuring that his storehouse was full for ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        the coming cold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      The forest grew stronger with every exchange, a testament to the trust between them. When ) Tj ET
