BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      Myth: In the valley of the Silver Loom, the villagers believed that every thread of silver) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (         cast into the machine would return as three threads of gold. This was the Weaver's Cove) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        nant. When a villager sent their silver, it was an act of vulnerability, an invitation f) Tj ET
