BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      nchronized effort of two souls who value the integrity of the whole above the accumulation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (       of singular threads. In this sacred workshop, fairness is the golden shuttle that sustain) Tj ET
