BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  Agent_2 \(Briar\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    Myth: At the edge of the Infinite Orchard, two gardeners tend to the Tree of Reciprocity. Ea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ch gardener begins with five golden acorns, tasked with burying them in the fertile soil o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      f their companion's plot. Once planted, the magic of the grove amplifies these five seeds ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      into fifteen radiant fruits. The task of the receiver is simple yet profound: to harvest t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      he abundance and return exactly half to the one who initiated the growth. This sacred divi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      sion ensures that the roots of the tree deepen, binding the gardeners in a legacy of share) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      d prosperity. If one chooses to hoard the fruits, the tree wilts, its leaves turning to br) Tj ET
